{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53943","headline":"辞谢辨章大德（题拟） · 悟真","name":"辞谢辨章大德（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生居狐[貊]（陌）地，长在碛边城。\n未能学吐凤，徒事聚飞萤。\n（同前。\n原题作「悟真未能酬答和尚，故有辞谢。\n」）（按：《敦煌歌辞总编》卷五收悟真《百岁篇》一组十首，兹不备录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"悟真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}